  "In Freeform mode, click and drag to draw the outline for a selection area.\n\nIn Polygon mode, click and drag to add a new point to the selection.\nPress Enter to finish the selection.\nPress Backspace to delete the last point.": "在自由模式下，點擊並拖曳以繪製選擇區域的輪廓。\n\n在多邊形模式下，點擊並拖曳以添加新的選擇點。\n按 Enter 鍵完成選擇。\n按 Backspace 鍵刪除最後一個點。",
