  "Layers": "圖層",
  "Left Align": "置左",
  "Left click and drag the selection to move selected content.\nHold {0} to scale instead of move.\nRight click and drag the selection to rotate selected content.\nHold Shift to rotate in steps.\nUse arrow keys to move selected content by a single pixel.": "左擊並拖曳選取的內容，即可移動選取的內容。\n按住 {0} 不移動，而是縮放。\n右鍵按一下並拖曳選取區域，可旋轉選取的內容。\n按住 Shift 可逐級旋轉。\n使用方向鍵將選取的內容移動一個像素。",
  "Left click and drag the selection to move selection outline.\nHold {0} to scale instead of move.\nRight click and drag the selection to rotate selection outline.\nHold Shift to rotate in steps.\nUse arrow keys to move selection outline by a single pixel.": "左擊並拖曳選取區域來移動選取輪廓。\n按住 {0} 不移動，而是縮放。\n按滑鼠右鍵並拖曳選取區域，以旋轉選取輪廓。\n按住 Shift 鍵可逐步旋轉。\n使用箭頭鍵移動選取範圍的單一像素。",
  "Left click to draw a shape with the primary color.\nLeft click on a shape to add a control point.\nLeft click on a control point and drag to move it.\nRight click on a control point and drag to change its tension.\nHold Shift to snap to angles.\nUse arrow keys to move the selected control point.\nPress {0} + left/right arrows to select control points by order.\nPress Delete to delete the selected control point.\nPress Space to add a new control point at the mouse position.\nHold {0} while pressing Space to create the control point at the exact same position.\nHold {0} while left clicking on a control point to create a new shape at the exact same position.\nPress Enter to finalize the shape.": "左鍵按一下以主色繪製形狀。\n在形狀上按一下滑鼠左鍵以加入控制點。\n在控制點上按一下滑鼠左鍵，然後拖曳來移動控制點。\n在控制點上按一下滑鼠右鍵，然後拖動以改變其張力。\n按住 Shift 鍵可捕捉角度。\n使用箭頭鍵移動選取的控制點。\n按 {0} + 左/右箭頭按順序選擇控制點。\n按 Delete 鍵刪除選取的控制點。\n按空格在滑鼠位置新增一個控制點。\n按住 {0} 的同時按空格，在完全相同的位置建立控制點。\n按住 {0}，同時左鍵點選控制點，在完全相同的位置建立新的形狀。\n按 Enter 鍵確定形狀。",
  "Left click to draw freeform one-pixel wide lines with the primary color.\nRight click to use the secondary color.": "按一下滑鼠左鍵，使用主要顏色繪製一像素寬的自由形線條。\n按一下滑鼠右鍵可使用次要顏色。",
  "Left click to draw with primary color, right click to draw with secondary color.": "畫圖時，按滑鼠左鍵畫出來的顏色是主要顏色，按滑鼠右鍵畫出來的顏色是次要顏色。",
  "Left click to erase to transparent, right click to erase to secondary color.": "按滑鼠左鍵擦拭變成透明，按滑鼠右鍵擦拭變成次要顏色。",
  "Left click to place cursor, then type desired text. Text color is primary color.": "點擊滑鼠左鍵，輸入想要的文字。文字顏色是主要顏色。",
  "Left click to replace the secondary color with the primary color.\nRight click to reverse.": "左鍵按一下可將次要顏色換成主要顏色。\n按一下滑鼠右鍵可反色。",
