  "Pinta is a image editing, drawing and painting application with a simple yet powerful interface. Pinta has a wide range of drawing tools, including: freehand, rectangles, circles and lines. It also has over 35 effects to apply to your images, and also has the ability to create unlimited layers to help organize your creativity.": "Pinta 是一款圖像編輯、繪圖和繪畫應用程式，介面簡單卻功能強大。Pinta 擁有多種繪圖工具，包括：自由繪圖、矩形、圓和線條。它還有超過 35 種效果可套用在您的圖像上，還能建立無限圖層，幫助您組織創意。",
